Patch for impressncsu/ICCV2025_MSLR at 7dd73c4e67b2959a95f828c103269723528b9271,
applied after 0001-data-paths.patch.

Concern: missing output (the video model the script trains is never saved).
Why necessary: resnet21D_V2.py trains with EarlyStopping(restore_best_weights=True)
and then only writes every-5-epoch checkpoints and an xlsx of held-out
predictions; there is no final model file for val_fusion_pred.py /
test_fusion_pred.py to load as video_final.h5. This adds one model.save() right
after model.fit(), persisting exactly the model the script ends with (the
restored best-val_loss weights). Training is unchanged. Selected by the operator
at gate protocol-training-recipe (alternative A1, 2026-11-09).

diff --git a/MSLR_radar_video/cnn_models_radar+video/resnet21D_V2.py b/MSLR_radar_video/cnn_models_radar+video/resnet21D_V2.py
